ODA Drawings Explorer is proprietary freeware by the Open Design Alliance
(ODA), built with the ODA SDK. This package repackages the official Linux
build, unmodified apart from using the system Qt runtime, as published at:

  https://www.opendesign.com/guestfiles/oda_drawings_explorer

ODA ships no license text with the download. Use and redistribution are
governed by ODA's terms; see https://www.opendesign.com for details.
